# If you miss the bus, you will be late. If you are late, your boss will be angry. Tom missed the bus.

predicate miss_bus {theme: e}
predicate late {theme: e}
predicate boss_of {theme: e, reference: e}
predicate angry {theme: e}

entity tom : e
entity boss1 : e

boss_of(theme: boss1, reference: tom)
miss_bus(theme: tom)

rule [x:e]: miss_bus(theme: x) -> late(theme: x)
rule [x:e, b:e]: late(theme: x) & boss_of(theme: b, reference: x) -> angry(theme: b)

? angry(theme: boss1)